    "description": {
      "en": "This is the third USC marginal rate, applied via the band_rate parameter in the txcin_ie SchedCalc function's 'Tax schedule: basic rates' to income falling between Threshold 2 and Threshold 3 (€70,044). Its latest value (3%, i.e. 0.03) matches the Country Report's 2025 figure for 'Rate 3', which has been reduced in recent years from 4.5% (2022-2023) to 4.0% (2024) and 3.0% (2025) - a downward trend reflected in the constant's 8 recorded historical values."
